    <!-- About + Local stats -->
    <string name="about_editorial_body">Relaxa e Dorme was created to offer a simple space to pause.\n\nMusic, ambient sounds, and quiet moments to accompany your rest, your focus, or the end of a long day.\n\nNo rush. No distractions. Just the right sound for every moment.\n\nA creation by mTaaz.</string>
