    <string name="about_privacy_title">Privacy &amp; transparency</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_body">Your statistics belong exclusively to this device, are never sent to external servers, and are never synced across devices. The app uses the internet only to fetch the catalog and stream content hosted on the server, keeping downloaded tracks available even offline.</string>

